"P1612889675" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor red>How's it goin' kiddo? Roy here. I've received some disturbing news. <t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor red>The PPD convoy with Stanfeld and Zanella was attacked moments ago by a group of masked thugs. Zanella and Stanfeld are now missing. <t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor red>We need you to get into the streets of Talos and see if you can find the two of them!"
