"P2908261366" "Is everything set with Zanella?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1410409838" "<em>It is. We've got everything now, they'll have to listen to our demands."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P427183067" "We've got company. Don't get in the way, {HeroName}, you could never understand how it is for people like us"
