// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3928846827" "Get ready for any interference. We can't let anyone jeapordize the operation."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P18433374" "We've dealt with your kind before, {HeroName}. We can do it again!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P4074019241" "<em>Roger that."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1887770043" "Assault Leader"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3226306312" "We've got Zanella in a remote location. Now it's just time to make the demands..."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4182680817" "Hero interference! You shouldn't have come here!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2836457115" "Now you die!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1738482053" "Nevermind"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ThugLeader 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P4291887840" "Track down the assault leader"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3418162210" "Lucas Zanella is gone, but you've arrested Sergeant Stanfeld, who helped to kidnap Zanella!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P946934329" "What happened, {HeroName}?<br><br>So, Stanfeld helped to kidnap Zanella? I'm betting the other thugs with him were part of the PPD who went rogue. This is a disturbing turn of events, {HeroName}. I knew that people were divided on the issue of the medi-porter, but I was hoping this divide wasn't going to affect the police. I can only assume that they're <i>also</i> behind the theft of the device. Argh! Stanfeld told us about Dogger just to buy himself some time!<br><br>We might've not gotten Zanella, but we've got Stanfeld. That's going to be a huge blow to this group. They might have the chip and the president, but we've got Stanfeld as our source of information for everything."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Stanfield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3637444517" "Hmph. What do you want, {HeroName}? You're here to try to get me to speak?<br><br><color orange>Stanfeld spits at you.</color><br><br>You supers don't know what's it like, walking around without your special medi-port technology! Do you know what it's like to know that if you make one wrong move your kid isn't going to have a father? Or that your wife could die if some freak looks at her wrong, but that some super who can't be hurt in the first place will have that safety net for them?"
// Answer Text :
"P1948939308" "Calm down, Stanfeld. You don't know what's going on!"
// Page Vigilante1 Text :
"P4292355793" "<color orange>Stanfeld sneers at you.</color><br><br>You're too late to stop us, {HeroName}. Don't you see?! This is the will of the people, the -"
// Answer Text :
"P3059929058" "(Cut off Stanfeld and explain the situation)"
// Page Vigilante2 Text :
"P1427868516" "<color orange>You cut off Stanfeld and explain the situation with the medi-porter and Praetoria. Stanfeld stands back with a shocked expression on his face.</color><br><br>I... I didn't know. {HeroName}, I didn't know. I thought this was all just a publicity thing, that they didn't care. But if what you said is true... then there's no time to lose.<br><br>I don't know where they took Zanella, but I can tell you where the chip is. It's on a cargo ship bound for Europe right now. They were going to bring it to scientists there to replicate the technology for citizens in Paragon. If you hurry, you can catch up to it.<br><br>You need to know, {HeroName}, that I'm not the head of this group. Someone else is pulling the strings, but I don't know who. Only <color yellow>Sergeant Fieldman</color> does. I'm truly sorry for everything, {HeroName}. Believe me."
// Answer Text :
"P3078723171" "I believe you. I just-"
// Page Vigilante3 Text :
"P4220307281" "<color orange>An explosion rocks the precinct and you hear the Family yell something about getting revenge for Louis Dogger!</color><br><br>It's the Family!"
// Answer Text :
"P3949126756" "I'll handle them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - InjuredDialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P59757963" "T-they attacked us, didn't even know it was c-coming. It was... it was the <color yellow>Sky Raiders!</color> Don't know how they found out about our operation..."
// Answer Text :
"P4220572350" "Did they get the device? Is it gone?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1109178575" "Didn't see them come out... with it yet... you've got to stop them, {HeroName}. We only meant... for the device to be used for the <i>people</i>. The raiders... they'll just sell it to... whoever the highest bidder is...!"
// Answer Text :
"P2106369586" "I'll get it back. Don't worry."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Rico 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P807136525" "{HeroName}, good to see you. I've got Stanfeld locked inside now. You better move fast, though. No one in the precinct knows why they were cleared out or that Stanfeld's in there."
// Answer Text :
"P808681264" "I'll be quick. (Start Mission)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1881476355" "Stanfeld is a decent man, {HeroName}. I still think he is, or at least I <i>hope</i> he is. I really believe that he's a man who will listen to reason. He doesn't know about what's going on behind the scenes with medi-porter tech and why this upgrade is so important.<br><br>If we appeal to his sense of decency, I think we can get him to crack about where they're keeping Zanella and the location of the tech. <br><br><color orange>You overhear Roy's cellphone ringing.</color><br><br>Now, I know we talked about that info about the medi-porters was top secret, but I don't think we have any choice about telling Stanfeld about it."
// AcceptString :
"P3609666147" "If he knows, do you think he'll help us?"
// SendOffString :
"P4034596567" "I do. Stanfeld wants to do what's right. All we gotta do is convince him that what <i>we're</i> doing is right. Best way to do that is to just be truthful and tell him the situation. We don't have the time to try to play the whole interrogation game, you understand?<br><br>We've got Stanfeld held in the precinct in Talos before he's supposed to be sent to the Zig. I had the precinct cleared for your interrogation of him. We've got four officers keeping watch on the place: Russel, Vitz, Hazen, and Bassins. You'll want to talk to Bassins to get clearance to go inside, he's got orders to only let you and anyone you trust inside of that place. In the meantime, I'll be working the angles with the FBSA to see if there's any connections between the Citizens for Medi-Porters and Stanfeld's group."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2775960512" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: A Decent Man</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P119342874" "Interrogate Sergeant Stanfeld"
