"P2812110344" "Paulie Poppers"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P205073477" "<shout>Come out, {HeroName}! You're gonna pay for Dogger!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3279884297" "I'm gonna enjoy every second of this, {HeroName}."

