"P427332958" "This place is collapsing, we need to get out of here!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1660808635" "<em>Not until we've secured the device, we've got orders!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3458118971" "This firefight got too out of hand, we got clumsy!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
