"P3922306124" "Sky Raider Jumpbot"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1974409317" "Medi-porter technology located. Acquisition process enabled."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2274249585" "Process interrupted. Attacking target: {HeroName}."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1867567338" "Jump Bot Incinerator"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P758195623" "<shout>Don't let {HeroName} get away with the tech!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Skiff 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P3231871084" "Fend off the incoming Sky Raiders"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1821697883" "You recovered the medi-porter technology!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P530852361" "{HeroName}! In the nick of time. Did you get the tech? Good, good. Send it over to me and I'll get it back to the boys over at Medi-Corp. It'll take them a while to implement the changes, but hopefully by then this will all have blown over. So the Sky Raiders tried to bring down the cargo ship and there was a note there that the Family hired them?<br><br>Hrm... no, something else is going on. The Sky Raiders may only be in it for the money, but they believe working for the Family is beneath them. The fact that you found that evidence so easily means that someone <i>wants</i> us to believe the Family is involved, just like that stunt Stanfeld pulled earlier. I'm going to investigate this angle further to find out who this third party could be.<br><br>Right now, we've got bigger fish to fry. If what you found near the tech is true, then Lawrence Harken is the one pulling the strings of the Rogue PPD. This information is going to be invaluable to us, especially given the recent circumstances that have just come up."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Rogue1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1736061301" "<color orange>You help the Rogue PPD agent back to his feet!</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3985561581" "Get out of here!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Rogue2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Rogue3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Rogue4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Rogue5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Rogue6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Rogue7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Rogue8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Rogue9 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Rogue10 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Rogue11 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Rogue12 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - CFMLeader 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2696993264" "Just stay away! I know you're just going to arrest me for everything... just... just let me die here. It's over. Everything is.. is <i>over</i>."
// Answer Text :
"P1611726065" "I'm bringing you in, alive. Come on, we're getting out of here!"
// Answer Text :
"P1083057326" "I'm not going to arrest you. When you get out of here, run!"
// Page Arrest Text :
"P3818663463" "<color orange>Harken's pauses for a moment before finally nodding to follow.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P1302134782" "Come on!"
// Page LeadAway Text :
"P2198473023" "You're... helping me get out of here? Alright... alright, let's go!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Roy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page ArrestedLeader Text :
"P1433272972" "Harken is being handled by agents of the FBSA now. He's agreed to name members of the PPD who were working with them. This will get him a lighter sentence, but he'll still have to serve some time in the Zig.<br><br>Harken revealed some disturbing information, however. It seems Sergeant Fieldman has taken control of the situation. He's the one who set up kidnapping Zanella. It's too bad for Harken. All he wanted was the help of the PPD in obtaining his goals without any violence, and now it's ending in this. But at least now we know where Zanella is being held. Ready to end this once and for all?"
// Answer Text :
"P2746312564" "Let's get moving."
// Page EscapedLeader Text :
"P2973337593" "What happened to Harken?<br><br>He wasn't able to make it out of there? That's a damn shame. All Harken wanted to do was help the people of Paragon, I'm guessing without any of this violence involved. Fieldman must have taken the reigns of the operations from Harken. We won't know how responsible Harken truly was until we bring in Fieldman. Luckily we know where Zanella and Fieldman both are right now. It's time for us to make our move."
// Answer Text :
"P1919903555" "Let's go."
// Page DeadLeader Text :
"P1826933101" "What happened to Harken?<br><br>He died in the fire? That's a damn shame. All Harken wanted to do was help the people of Paragon, I'm guessing without any of this violence involved. Fieldman must have taken the reigns of the operations from Harken. We won't know how responsible Harken truly was until we bring in Fieldman. Luckily we know where Zanella and Fieldman both are right now. It's time for us to make our move."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2727970672" "While you were gone, the Rogue PPD released a broadcast. In it, they have Zanella tied to a chair with two armed thugs beside him. One man, who I'm guessing by Stanfeld's testimony is the 'leader' of the Rogue PPD, is threatening to kill Zanella if Medi-Corp does not listen to their demands and put out a prototype medi-porter for the people of Paragon City. I admire their determination to get the job done, but they don't understand what's at stake here.<br><br>Medi-Corp is refusing to budge, saying that there's too many risks if they tried to release a system like that in such a short amount of time. The members of the PPD working on the case say they have no idea where Zanella is being held... but then again, we don't know if these PPD are on <i>our</i> side or not. Good thing that we know who the mastermind is behind this, eh? <color yellow>Lawrence Harken.</color><br><br>It's too bad. Harken was a good man, family man like me. But he crossed the line and now we've got to make our move. If anyone is going to know where they're holding Zanella, it's going to be Harken."
// AcceptString :
"P641167800" "Do you know where Harken is?"
// SendOffString :
"P3846153539" "I just so happen to know. The Citizens for Medi-Porters have a small office over here in Talos Island. My bet is that he's there now. If we hurry, we can catch him by surprise. He and his team may not know about what happened on the cargo ship.<br><br>Also, {HeroName}, I know it'll be tough, but when you find Harken, take it easy on him. He's not a super or ex-military, he's just a regular guy, a pencil-pusher who decided to attach himself to this cause. From the research I did, it sounds like he latched himself onto this group after his son died in a botched rescue attempt by a hero. The man meant well, but somewhere along the way he lost his sense of right and wrong. Let's see what we can do to at least bring some justice to this situation."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P492495018" "Find Lawrence Harken"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3975579132" "I'm monitoring the situation with Zanella. We're still in a stalemate."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2992122876" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four: The Only Way</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1077721996" "You enter the building to see members of the Rogue PPD standing guard. You'll have to get through them to reach Harken."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3294014544" "5 minutes until the interior collapses"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3490790415" "Fieldman is insane. This was never supposed to be part of the plan! Harken is a good man!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P439620800" "<em>Do you want this getting out? Who we are? Our identities? This is the only way."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P401839245" "{HeroName}! This wasn't supposed to happen!"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1219709722" "We all have to go to some extreme measures to get what we want!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3571567476" "Now we die..."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3180591499" "Is this what we really have to do to keep our children safe? Harken's life for the safety of the entire city?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P658009323" "<em>And for our safety. He knows who we all are. He could name -all- of us."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1046720349" "{HeroName}! We can't let you through!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3957481504" "Fieldman's out of his mind. We're not criminals!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2194351513" "<em>This is all going south! We have to try to recover this situation by any means necessary."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P857957570" "Mr. Y"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2818750598" "Right. Everything's rigged now. I''ve got the address for Zanella's location. I'll head there afterwards."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P117585631" "Hold on. We've got hero trouble, I'll handle this!"

