"P2111044303" "You're met outside by three SWAT Sergeants. It's time to break through the Rogue PPD to rescue Lucas Zanella!"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P4245938297" "One minute until Rogue PPD sends in an attack team"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3731466081" "Forty seconds until the next Rogue PPD attack team pushes"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3299296872" "Thirty seconds until the next Rogue PPD attack team pushes"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P559198640" "Twenty seconds until the final Rogue PPD attack team pushes"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P465310591" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Dark Cyan>This is Colonel Ford, of the Sky Raiders. <t=7 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Dark Cyan>We have the president of Medi-Corp in our custody. Unlike these amateurs, we fully intend to kill him if we don't get what we want. <t=7 caption x= 0.4 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Dark Cyan> If you want to see the president alive again, you will bring the chip for the new medi-port technology to a secure location. <t=7 caption x= 0.4 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Dark Cyan> A submarine will be waiting for you in Striga Isle. If you try to pull anything, I assure you we will cut our losses and kill the president."
