// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2594850889" "You're taken by submarine to the underwater sea base of the Sky Raiders."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P328844038" "One minute until Sky Raider reinforcements arrive"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P668303369" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Dark Cyan>No funny moves, {HeroName}. We've got cameras watching you. <t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Dark Cyan>Just place the chip in the computer and we can all go home happy. <t=7 caption x= 0.4 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkOliveGreen>This is Roy, I'm in position, I've got a positive ID on Zanella. Make the switch and I'll see about getting that chip's data back to us."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P576656507" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=20><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Dark Cyan>Alright, we're downloading the data now... <t=5 caption x= 0.4 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkOliveGreen>I'm working on getting the chip now. I've got Zanella in my sight, they haven't harmed him. <t=5 caption x= 0.4 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkOliveGreen>Hrm... something isn't right here. The transfer on my end stopped. This could be a problem. <t=5 caption x= 0.4 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkOliveGreen>Alright, this is a definite problem, {HeroName}. The transfer on my end was botched, they know I'm in the system! <t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Dark Cyan>Someone's trying to access the system! You made a bad move today, {HeroName}. Kill Zanella and make sure {HeroName} doesn't get out of here alive!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1959294168" "<t=5 caption x= 0.4 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkOliveGreen>I'll handle getting Zanella. I've got the elevator unlocked for you, get to their security terminal to get that chip!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2586913855" "<t=5 caption x= 0.4 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkOliveGreen>The chief didn't have the chip? That Malta agent must have it, he's probably trying to escape! <t=5 caption x= 0.4 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkOliveGreen>I'll handle getting Zanella out of here, in the meantime use the codes that the chief had to get into the rest of the base! <t=5 caption x= 0.4 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkOliveGreen> First priority should be to destroy one of their main communication computers before they call in Malta reinforcements!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1622991577" "<t=5 caption x= 0.4 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkOliveGreen> Got a reading that Captain Castillo is nearby, he's one of the higher ups in the Raiders. <t=5 caption x= 0.4 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkOliveGreen> You'll have to get by him to get to their main base. When you're up there, hack into the mainframe of their turrets. <t=5 caption x= 0.4 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkOliveGreen> If you can bring down the firewall, I can activate the self-terminate sequence to clear the area for you."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2783747810" "<t=5 caption x= 0.4 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkOliveGreen> That agent has the chip, {HeroName}! Finish off Castillo and get out of there with the chip and the agent! <t=5 caption x= 0.4 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkOliveGreen> The convoy is here now to bring Zanella and I back, we'll see you back in Paragon!"
